Later, one of [[Rassimov]]'s [[Suits]] invoked Impet to attack Dante and [[Sophie]] but was caught in a [[Bubblelift]] power and defeated by [[Sabriel]]. {{Source|Memory Lane}}

In [[Turkey]], Impet was invoked by one of Rassimov's Suits to attack the Huntik team. He attempted to blast Lok but was defeated by [[Cherit]]. {{Source|Ladies' Choice}}

At the [[Temple of Poseidon]], Impet was invoked by one of Rassimov's Suits. He fired an unsuccessful energy blast at Lok before backing up due to a [[Raypulse]] from Sophie. {{Source|The Unseen Guide}}
